[{"field": "body", "quote": "By using the CDN, any client will automatically open a connection to https://storage.googleapis.com/workbox-cdn/releases/... and inevitably transmit his IP address", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "f325936ec12f68d098fcbd2a48d8ca4e3ca80ae8544727f3b12ad8eafb6b4ea5"}, {"field": "body", "quote": "if many pages include it via a CDN, tracking a client between different sites becomes possible", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "f325936ec12f68d098fcbd2a48d8ca4e3ca80ae8544727f3b12ad8eafb6b4ea5"}, {"field": "body", "quote": "this would either need an additional config to let the site owner decide whether local files or the CDN should be used, or no changes at all if we could switch from CDN-only to local-only", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "f325936ec12f68d098fcbd2a48d8ca4e3ca80ae8544727f3b12ad8eafb6b4ea5"}, {"field": "body", "quote": "This would also be the easiest option compared to obtaining the clients permission beforehand.", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "f325936ec12f68d098fcbd2a48d8ca4e3ca80ae8544727f3b12ad8eafb6b4ea5"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "a quick default improvement could still be to add `ga('set', 'anonymizeIp', true);` and `forceSSL: true` to the default GA integration", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "5074efda87edb89228360ee2a9124d8e927a202087bdd2f91fe913264e13fcb5"}, {"field": "body", "quote": "IP address, which is regarded as personal information under EU law", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "f325936ec12f68d098fcbd2a48d8ca4e3ca80ae8544727f3b12ad8eafb6b4ea5"}, {"field": "body", "quote": "As under the European General Data Protection Regulation, the site owner is responsible for any leak of personal information", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "f325936ec12f68d098fcbd2a48d8ca4e3ca80ae8544727f3b12ad8eafb6b4ea5"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "In some country, is impossible to load Workbox Files from google cdn.", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "5074efda87edb89228360ee2a9124d8e927a202087bdd2f91fe913264e13fcb5"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "the current configuration neither anonymises the IP address nor limits tracking", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "5074efda87edb89228360ee2a9124d8e927a202087bdd2f91fe913264e13fcb5"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "add `ga('set', 'anonymizeIp', true);`", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "5074efda87edb89228360ee2a9124d8e927a202087bdd2f91fe913264e13fcb5"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "or adding an option like
```js
await wbb.generateSW({
   importWorkboxFrom: SW_IMPORT,", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "5074efda87edb89228360ee2a9124d8e927a202087bdd2f91fe913264e13fcb5"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "generateSWConfig: {
         importWorkboxFrom: 'local'
       }", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "5074efda87edb89228360ee2a9124d8e927a202087bdd2f91fe913264e13fcb5"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "this feature is simple to be implemented directly at [@vuepress/plugin-pwa]", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "5074efda87edb89228360ee2a9124d8e927a202087bdd2f91fe913264e13fcb5"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "as I could also imagine to move this into a plugin later on", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "5074efda87edb89228360ee2a9124d8e927a202087bdd2f91fe913264e13fcb5"}, {"field": "body", "quote": "any client will automatically open a connection to https://storage.googleapis.com/workbox-cdn/releases/... and inevitably transmit his IP address", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "f325936ec12f68d098fcbd2a48d8ca4e3ca80ae8544727f3b12ad8eafb6b4ea5"}, {"field": "content", "quote": "Evidence availability: complete", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "1a650f90d7b6df520f8a4ab151a5f6f8a078710c16f849e550d6edbe77ad70f4"}, {"field": "content", "quote": "Retrieved issue comments: 6/6", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "1a650f90d7b6df520f8a4ab151a5f6f8a078710c16f849e550d6edbe77ad70f4"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "Fixed at 4640614. In `1.0.0.alpha-47` you can get this by:", "source": "https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/539", "field_sha256": "5074efda87edb89228360ee2a9124d8e927a202087bdd2f91fe913264e13fcb5"}]

[{"field": "body", "quote": "I would like to be able to have Google Analytics plugin disabled by default. Then ask the user's consent and only then enable it.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "3f4630c03e3bb581fb76c27f834168def5ddc3929cbce6d5117215097d5673aa"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "once the user clicks on "I agree" we set `window.gdpr-agreed = true`. Then in Gatsby, we have a condition declaring the GTM & GA code `if(window.gdpr-agreed) ... `", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "Gatsby should just give control to the owner whether the plugin is enabled or not and allow to enable it at run time, rather than built time.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "body", "quote": "I would like to be able to have Google Analytics plugin disabled by default. Then ask the user's consent and only then enable it.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "3f4630c03e3bb581fb76c27f834168def5ddc3929cbce6d5117215097d5673aa"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "using google analytics is OK (even in Europe) if you anonymize IPs and also disable cross session (bad) cookies.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": ""highPrivacy": false, /* Disable auto consent */", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "body", "quote": "Google's products, such as Google Analytics must have user's consent in order to work in a page.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "3f4630c03e3bb581fb76c27f834168def5ddc3929cbce6d5117215097d5673aa"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "gtag('config', 'UA-...', {
      'anonymize_ip': true,
      'cookie_expires': 0
  });", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "Currently plugin allows to anonymize IP, but doesn't allow (cannot see option) to enable session only cookies - `cookie_expires`.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "body", "quote": "Google's new [EU user consent policy](https://www.google.com/about/company/consentstaging.html) states that Google's products, such as Google Analytics must have user's consent in order to work in a page.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "3f4630c03e3bb581fb76c27f834168def5ddc3929cbce6d5117215097d5673aa"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "As I understand (don't take as lawyer advice) whole GDPR (no consent) compliant code might be:", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "We use a specific CDN for Europe and another set of CDN for the rest of the world.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "using google analytics is OK (even in Europe) if you anonymize IPs and also disable cross session (bad) cookies.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "Currently plugin allows to anonymize IP, but doesn't allow (cannot see option) to enable session only cookies - `cookie_expires`.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "'anonymize_ip': true,", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "No @sebastienfi I don't think this is Gatsby's responsibility at all. This must be left at the owner's choice.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "It would be cool a cool feature to have this embedded in the gatsby-plugin.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "Gatsby should just give control to the owner whether the plugin is enabled or not", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "I'm adding here the way I worked to implement a GDPR cookie notice on a Gatsby website. I'm sure it's not "as it should be", but it's working with tarteaucitron.js", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "I published this a couple months back for GDPR compliance:
https://www.gatsbyjs.org/packages/gatsby-plugin-cookiehub/", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": ""handleBrowserDNTRequest": false, /* If Do Not Track == 1, accept all */", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": ""privacyUrl": "", /* Privacy policy url */", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": ""showAlertSmall": true, /* Show the small banner on bottom right */
	    "cookieslist": true, /* Show the cookie list */", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": ""moreInfoLink": true, /* Show more info link */", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "This issue has gone quiet. Spooky quiet. 👻", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "It’s been 30 days since anything happened on this issue, so our friendly neighborhood robot (that’s me!) is going to close it.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "discussion", "quote": "Please keep in mind that I’m only a robot, so if I’ve closed this issue in error, I’m `HUMAN_EMOTION_SORRY`.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e9dafaaa30b99354719dcad1494cf2a641195e116c51f145314e71aa9e7e1877"}, {"field": "content", "quote": "Evidence availability: complete", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e91e78210eb285f74139c53566bce44ce1f82854cdd1145ec042ffb109aaf7af"}, {"field": "content", "quote": "Retrieved issue comments: 11/11", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e91e78210eb285f74139c53566bce44ce1f82854cdd1145ec042ffb109aaf7af"}, {"field": "content", "quote": "Scope: Current retrievable issue body and issue comments; not the original study's historical snapshot.", "source": "https://github.com/gatsbyjs/gatsby/issues/4976", "field_sha256": "e91e78210eb285f74139c53566bce44ce1f82854cdd1145ec042ffb109aaf7af"}]
